{#
  Changelog template owned by this repository.

  `cz`'s stock template emits only the release sections, so a full
  `cz changelog` regeneration deletes the header while `cz bump --changelog`
  preserves the file it is inserting into. Neither behaviour is wrong on its
  own; emitting the header unconditionally is, because the bump path then ends
  up with two of them.

  `cz` passes its `incremental` flag to the template, and bump sets it. So the
  header is emitted only for a full regeneration, and the bump path keeps the
  copy already in the file. `scripts/verify-changelog.ts` fails the build if
  this ever produces a missing or duplicated header.

  Selected by `template = "CHANGELOG.j2"` in .cz.toml; `cz` resolves it from the
  repository root.
#}
{% if not incremental %}
# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are documented here.
The format follows [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/).
Entries are generated from the commit history by [Commitizen](https://commitizen-tools.github.io/commitizen/); do not edit them by hand.
{% endif %}
